<title>NORWAY: Norske Skog gets Golbey plant go-ahead.</title>
<headline>Norske Skog gets Golbey plant go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian forestry group Norske Skog ASA said on Thursday that local French authorities had given the green light for its new newsprint facility at Golbey, France.</p>
<p>The new unit will be on line in the first quarter of 1999, the company said in a statement to the Oslo Bourse.</p>
<p>Norske Skog announced three months ago it planned to invest 2.8 billion crowns in expanding production at its newsprint plant in Golbey.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
